WEBVTT - Savoria Filipina Masterclass Subtitles

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Maligayang pagdating sa Savoria Filipina! Today we prepare authentic Chicken and Pork Adobo.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 1: Marinate meat in cane vinegar, silver swan soy sauce, garlic, and whole black peppercorns.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.500
Step 2: Simmer gently until tender, then sear the meat in its own rendered oils until crisp.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.000
Serve hot over steamed jasmine rice. Kain tayo!
